# FreelancersConnect

A front-end freelance marketplace demo built with HTML, CSS and vanilla JavaScript.

## Features
- Landing page with reviews carousel and featured jobs
- Register / login (stored in the browser)
- Post a job with an optional image; click an image to view it full size
- Browse available jobs and a freelancer dashboard with a slide-in sidebar

## Run locally
Open the folder in VS Code and start it with the Live Server extension (or open `index.html`).

## Important: how data is stored
There is no backend. Accounts and jobs are saved in each visitor's own browser
(`localStorage`), so nothing is shared between users or devices, and passwords are
stored unencrypted. This is a demo - please don't use a real password.